spans.s:
पृ॑श्नि a. speckled, dapple;
 pl. manifold, various. —m. N.
of a prince, pl. N. of a race of Ṛṣis;
 f. a dappled cow, milk, the
earth, a cloud, the starry sky, N. of the mother of the Maruts.

पृषत॑ m. the spotted antelope;
 drop of water;
 spot, mark.

पृ॑षन्त् f. पृ॑षती spotted, dappled. —m. the spotted
antelope;
 f. a spotted cow, mare, or female antelope;
 n. drop of water.

पृष्ठ॑ n. back (esp. of an animal);
 hinder part, rear;
upper side, surface, top (of a hill or palace);
 loc. behind the back,
behind or from behind.

पृष्ठत॑स् adv. from the back, from behind;
 at the back
of, behind (gen. or —˚);
 with the back i.e. with averted face;
 behind
the back i.e. secretly, privately. — With कृ take on the back;
 place
behind the back i.e. neglect, forsake, abandon.

पृष्ठमांस n. back-flesh;
 ˚सं खाद् bite the
back-flesh i.e. backbite, speak ill.

पृष्ठ्य॑ a. carrying on the back;
 m. (±अश्व) pack- or
riding-horse.
